{
 "scope": "Codimension-m COMPACT-SLICE MEASURABILITY, and the chain it completes: weighted slice measurability WITH NO REGULARITY HYPOTHESIS, in the Borel-set form and the open-C1-domain form. NOT a coarea formula: what is removed is the regularity hypothesis from the MEASURABILITY half, not from the coarea EQUALITY. No hole migrated. The log-concave Cheeger-Buser line belongs to collaborator Wang Haocheng and was not touched.",
 "head": "34b92695ece4f636a1a7f1eafbbf41c685ee0348",
 "origin_main": "34b92695ece4f636a1a7f1eafbbf41c685ee0348",
